5" :question/math-academy-id "q-78358" :question/problem "What is the center of the hyperbola $\\frac{(y+2)^{2}}{7}-\\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{4}=1?$" :question/worked-solution "The equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nNote that the given equation can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-(-2))^{2}}{7}-\\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{4}=1\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $h=3$ and $k=-2.$\n\nTherefore, the center of the hyperbola is $(3,-2).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-78358/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cdab0134-e416-51cf-89fa-73ad4a2c2eb9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-78358"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-328353/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "0748a8a7-5c3c-55dd-85f1-1a326b47bfb4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-328353/field-1/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "63d67eef-27b8-5ec1-b18a-5d8d25c5cd5c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-328353/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8d02687d-6773-549a-873d-34092974de96" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-328353/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-328353/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-328353/field-1/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-328353/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "b9ebc2c8-4a38-508b-a7f0-ca9d2bf3d908" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-328353/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "eb9296ac-805f-5afc-86cf-6833ac07a5b9" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-328353/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-328353/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-328353" :question/id #uuid "25aaf0a3-1775-57b0-bf67-4610b7f14f89" :question/math-academy-id "q-328353" :question/problem "The center of the hyperbola $3{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}-12x+16y=28$ is$\\,\\,($\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" :question/worked-solution "The equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in the above form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}-12x+16y & =28 \\\\ 3{x}^{2}-12x-4{y}^{2}+16y & =28 \\\\ 3[{x}^{2}-4x]-4[{y}^{2}-4y] & =28 \\\\ 3[(x-2)^{2}-4]-4[(y-2)^{2}-4] & =28 \\\\ 3(x-2)^{2}-12-4(y-2)^{2}+16 & =28 \\\\ 3(x-2)^{2}-4(y-2)^{2} & =28+12-16 \\\\ 3(x-2)^{2}-4(y-2)^{2} & =24 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{8}-\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{6} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{8})^{2}}-\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{6})^{2}} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center of the hyperbola is $(\\,2,2\\,).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-328353/field-1" "q-328353/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "223e29c9-1bb5-51ee-9ec8-4d5c15363951"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-328353"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-328402/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "6da97c55-c72c-5da2-b8b9-0c405517239d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-328402/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "d309196f-6522-57bf-a0da-99e3698af87c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-328402/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-328402/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-328402/field-2/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "d54d0aed-fc02-5315-b529-b75c6db6c4b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-328402/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "85da2834-3da0-5c39-ba57-d19dc0b800b7" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-328402/field-2/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-328402/field-2/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-328402" :question/id #uuid "2e40da79-2484-51fc-9da4-6b12184cc73b" :question/math-academy-id "q-328402" :question/problem "The center of the hyperbola ${y}^{2}-4{x}^{2}+40x=136$ is$\\,\\,($\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" :question/worked-solution "The equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in the above form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-4{x}^{2}+40x & =136 \\\\ {y}^{2}\\,-\\,4{x}^{2}+40x & =136 \\\\ {y}^{2}\\,-\\,4[{x}^{2}-10x] & =136 \\\\ {y}^{2}\\,-\\,4\\,[(x-5)^{2}-25] & =136 \\\\ {y}^{2}-4(x-5)^{2}+100 & =136 \\\\ {y}^{2}-4(x-5)^{2} & =36 \\\\ \\frac{(y-0)^{2}}{36}-\\frac{(x-5)^{2}}{9} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center of the hyperbola is $(\\,5,0\\,).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-328402/field-1" "q-328402/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "345d6df7-2ada-5c2e-8146-7c779afae3af"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-328402"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
